      "says": [
        {
          "text": "He goes quiet, which for Hral is out of character. “It does. In a wind there is no wind for.” He starts walking again. “Karn Dolur laid that span. The hold will tell you the span is dwarf work, which it is, and will not discuss what it was laid *on*, which it did not make.”"
        }
