      "id": "deep_hral_hum2_told",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "“Before the hold, and the hold is old.” He does not slow down. “There is no wind down here. There has never been a wind down here. It hums in one anyway, and Karn Dolur will tell you that is the span settling, and the span has been settling for nine hundred years.”"
        }
